      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.0-beta.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <p>Second beta of AirothyServer.</p>
        <h3>What's fixed</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Pairing between iPhone and Mac now persists reliably across server restarts.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>If you previously paired an iPhone, you'll need to re-pair once after this update: remove the Mac entry on the iPhone, then pair again. After this one re-pair, future updates keep the pairing intact.</p>
      ]]></description>
