      <title>1.0.0-beta.1</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 13:29:55 +0900</pubDate>
      <sparkle:channel>beta</sparkle:channel>
      <sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.0-beta.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <p>First beta of AirothyServer — control your Mac from your iPhone.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Pair your iPhone with your Mac and use it as a trackpad and keyboard.</li>
          <li>3-finger swipes for Mission Control and Spaces.</li>
          <li>Function-row keys, media controls, and modifiers.</li>
          <li>In-app auto-updates (you'll get a prompt when the next build ships).</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
